  "summary": "Butthole Surfers are an American rock band formed in San Antonio, Texas, by singer Gibby Haynes and guitarist Paul Leary in 1981. The band has had numerous personnel changes, but its core lineup of Haynes, Leary, and drummer King Coffey remained consistent since 1983. Teresa Nervosa served as second drummer, playing alongside Coffey from 1983 to 1985, 1986 to 1989, and 2009. The band had also employed a variety of bass players, most notably Jeff Pinkus.",
